      "id": "claim_726267a0527042f68be506bd63367676",
      "statement": "SanctionScreen (SYS-PRSP-SSC) is a Tier-1 system within the Payment Risk & Screening Platform (PRSP) that performs OFAC and other sanctions-list screening, with Grace Mensah (EM, FCT - PRSP) as technical owner and Michael Tran (SVP, OFAC/Sanctions Officer) as business owner.",
